---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="丝网规格表 — 目数、丝径、开孔 | MeshCalculator" description="不锈钢编织丝网常用规格对照表：目数、丝径、开孔尺寸快速查询。" lang="zh">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-theme-primary">丝网规格表</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-theme-secondary">不锈钢编织网常用规格。开孔 = 25.4 ÷ 目数 − 丝径。</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mt-8">常用规格（不锈钢 304/316）</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-4">
      <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="text-left px-3 py-2 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary text-theme-primary font-semibold">目数</th>
            <th class="text-left px-3 py-2 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary text-theme-primary font-semibold">丝径 (mm)</th>
            <th class="text-left px-3 py-2 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary text-theme-primary font-semibold">开孔 (mm)</th>
            <th class="text-left px-3 py-2 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary text-theme-primary font-semibold">典型用途</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">2</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1.80</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10.90</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">粗筛</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">4</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1.20</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">5.15</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">砂石筛分</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">8</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.70</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">2.48</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">过滤支撑</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">12</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.50</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1.62</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">过滤网</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">20</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.40</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.87</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">水过滤</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">40</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.25</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.39</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">水/油过滤</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">60</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.19</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.23</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">精细过滤</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">80</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.14</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.18</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">超细过滤</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">100</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.10</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.154</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">标准滤布</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">150</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.07</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.099</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">精细筛分</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">200</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.05</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.077</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">制药</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">325</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.035</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.043</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">实验室/制药</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">400</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.030</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.034</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">超细</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mt-10">线规 ↔ 毫米（常用丝网丝径）</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-4">
      <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="text-left px-3 py-2 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary text-theme-primary font-semibold">SWG 线规</th>
            <th class="text-left px-3 py-2 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary text-theme-primary font-semibold">直径 (mm)</th>
            <th class="text-left px-3 py-2 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary text-theme-primary font-semibold">SWG 线规</th>
            <th class="text-left px-3 py-2 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary text-theme-primary font-semibold">直径 (mm)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">10</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">3.25</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">26</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.46</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">12</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">2.64</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">28</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.38</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">14</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">2.03</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">30</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.32</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">16</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1.63</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">32</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.27</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">18</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1.22</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">34</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.23</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">20</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.91</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">36</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.19</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">22</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.71</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">38</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.15</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-theme"><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">24</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.56</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-primary">40</td><td class="px-3 py-2 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">0.12</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted mt-4">中国工厂通常以毫米（mm）报价丝径，而非线规。请始终以毫米为单位明确要求，避免混淆。</p>

    <div class="mt-10 bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-xl p-6">
      <p class="font-semibold text-theme-primary">需要计算特定规格的重量？</p>
      <a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="accent-text font-semibold">使用重量计算器 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
